Adaptive bitrate for Jellyfin: real per-variant transcodes, a resolution-stepped ladder reaching above and below
the requested bitrate, the lowest rung as its own transcode, rungs aligned to the segment grid for gapless switches, and init segment requests that survive a job restart. git diff v10.11.11 of drizzelat/jellyfin abr-prototype.

